    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24952" root="صمي" body-key="S">
    
      7 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">انصمى عَلَيْهِ</span></b>  <i>He darted down,</i> or <i>rushed,</i>
(<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِنْصَبَّ</span>, S, K, or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِنْقَضَّ</span>, M, [both meaning the
same,]) <i>upon him,</i> (S, M, K,) and <i>advanced
towards him</i> (M,) to which Az adds, <i>like as the
hawk,</i> or <i>falcon, darts down</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَنْصَمِى</span>, i. e. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَنْقَضُّ</span>).
(TA.)

